<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  This is a polite follow-up regarding an open balance for <strong><%= @client&.name %></strong>:
  milestone <strong><%= @agenda_item.title %></strong> (<%= number_to_currency(@invoice.amount) %> <%= @invoice.currency %>),
  issued <%= @invoice.issued_at&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>.
</p>

<% if @invoice.external_url.present? %>
  <p><%= link_to "View or pay invoice", @invoice.external_url %></p>
<% end %>

<p>
  <% case @reminder_day %>
  <% when 7 %>
    If payment is already on the way, please disregard this note.
  <% when 14 %>
    We wanted to check in and confirm whether you need an updated copy of the invoice or a different payment method.
  <% when 30 %>
    We still show this invoice as unpaid. Please let us know if there is anything blocking payment so we can resolve it quickly.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p>Thank you,<br><%= ENV.fetch("AGENCY_BILLING_SIGNATURE", "Your delivery team") %></p>
